              "short": "$1,7,49,343$",
              "worked": "Start with $7^0=1$ and multiply each value by $7$.\n$$\\begin{aligned}7^0&=1,&7^1&=7,\\\\7^2&=49,&7^3&=343.\\end{aligned}$$",
              "solutionDiagrams": []
            },
            "answerSpaceMm": 20
          }
        ]
      },
      {
