              "worked": "Since $4=2^2$, select every second power of $2$, starting with $2^0$.\n$$\\begin{aligned}4^0&=1,&4^1&=4,\\\\4^2&=16,&4^3&=64,\\\\4^4&=256,&4^5&=1024,\\\\4^6&=4096.\\end{aligned}$$",
